--- task
id: s01
dataset: social
kind: one hop, ordered
answer: fewest

--- intent
Who liked the comment `$comment`? Return their names in alphabetical order.

--- params
{"comment": "c1"}

--- edition2
query likers($comment: String) {
  match { $c: Comment { slug: $comment }  $p likesComment $c }
  return { $p.name }
  order { $p.name }
}

--- edition3
query likers($comment: String) {
  match { $c: Comment { slug: $comment }  $p likesComment $c }
  return { $p.name }
  order { $p.name }
}

--- expect ordered
columns: ["p.name"]
["Ann Lee"]
["Bob Ray"]
